<section class="section section--flush page-hero"><div class="container prose"><h1>Industrial Furniture and Control Centers</h1></div></section><section class="section section--tint"><div class="container prose"><h2 class="section-title">Control rooms we have built</h2><p>Three control rooms designed and built for one industrial power plant: a plant control room in 2011, a central control room in 2015, and operator console panels supplied in 2010. All three are in continuous operation.</p>
